{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"stables","model_identifier":"stables","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# stables\n\nStables: a long stall building with split half-doors (top halves open), a hay rack along the front, and a fenced riding ring.\n\n- Footprint: 14 x 12 columns (224 x 192 units, 6.30 x 5.40 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -102..102, y 0..127, z -94..92 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 103, construction_0 28, construction_33 37, construction_66 49, ruined 28 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- stall building: 192 x 128 x 64 centred at x 0, z 56\n- riding ring: fence 192 x 18 x 96 at z -44 (walk-through)\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `stables_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `stables_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_stables` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, 14)\n- `slot_rally` at (100, 0, -44)\n"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"st_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-98.0,0.0,22.0],"to":[98.0,3.0,90.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,362.0,196.0,365.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[385.0,362.0,453.0,365.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,362.0,196.0,365.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[385.0,362.0,453.0,365.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,137.0,196.0,205.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,137.0,196.0,205.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"9484f4b6-1bcd-5b22-a745-a8721cb25c47"},{"name":"st_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-96.0,3.0,24.0],"to":[96.0,87.0,28.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[207.0,0.0,399.0,84.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[467.0,0.0,471.0,84.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[207.0,0.0,399.0,84.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[467.0,0.0,471.0,84.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[258.0,345.0,450.0,349.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[258.0,345.0,450.0,349.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"35d6b49b-dc6b-5942-b249-bf8b4a3b679c"},{"name":"st_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-96.0,3.0,84.0],"to":[96.0,87.0,88.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[207.0,0.0,399.0,84.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[471.0,0.0,475.0,84.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[207.0,0.0,399.0,84.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[471.0,0.0,475.0,84.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,351.0,192.0,355.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,351.0,192.0,355.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"b2fc4942-2442-525f-94cf-604a1658fd71"},{"name":"st_w0_w","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_e